    "body": "@annevk you are right, I've answered something else ... the thing with listeners is that Custom Elements / components might do expensive operations in the `disconnectedCallback` or `connectedCallback`, and there's no way to know if these were triggered after a diffing, as the node maybe was just moved instead, so that actually a `changedPosition` callback could be useful instead, but that's a whole different story. Hopefully this answers better.",
