    "body": "If you could quantify the cost somehow it might be interesting to see if it's valuable to have primitives for \"perform this DOM operation\", but don't invoke any of the callbacks. You get that for free if you don't have any callbacks, but indeed you cannot avoid some of them for certain use cases, but might still want to avoid calling them sometimes.",
